<title>LUXEMBOURG: EU to pay 1997 oilseed area aid in full.</title>
<headline>EU to pay 1997 oilseed area aid in full.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will pay 1997 oilseed area aid payments, estimated at 1.3 billion ecus, in full because there were now sufficient funds, EU Farm Commissioner Franz Fischler said on Monday.</p>
<p>A European Commission spokesman said that Fischler told EU farm ministers that he had dropped a proposal to postpone 60 percent of the payment until 1998.</p>
<p>The area aid payments compensate farmers for revenue losses due to farm reforms agreed in 1992.</p>
<p>The 1997 payment is due by October 15.</p>
</text>
